It is now Saturday afternoon.
This week's café shift is also finished.
Sunita says, "Maya, you are tired today."
I say, "Yes, today the weather is hotter than yesterday."
"It is sticky heat right now."
The monsoon is coming soon.
Therefore, there is a need for new clothes.
I say thank you to Sunita.
I depart from the café to go to the shop.
I go to the bus stop.
There I board a bus.
The conductor comes near me.
I say, "Please give me one ticket to go to the main market."
The conductor gives the ticket.
I give him twenty rupees.
There is a large crowd on the bus.
But I sit near the window.
Outside, a hot wind is blowing.
Even so, I am excited to buy new clothes.
